>can tunnel through walls, and both can wield what they pick up.

I have had no trouble with giants taking stuff from piles of weapons.

Method 1: Store piles of stuff on a different level.

Method 2: Pile lots of crap on top of the good weapons.  The giant
won't reach your Curved Sword Of Hudson Slaying very quickly if there
are 50 daggers, 42 short swords, 5 knifes, 500,000 rocks, and a
stuffed partridge on top of it.  I put a boulder on top of the whole
pile to keep curious orcs and small children from making a mess.

Hint: Monsters are statistically likely to spend most of their time
near the middle of the level.  Hide your stuff near the fringe,
preferably near the end of a twisty passage that you dug behind a
closed door.

